** Collection interface :-
        1. Collection is an interface defined in java.util.
        2.collection interface provide the mechanism to store group of objects(elements) together
        3.All the element in the collection are store in the form  of objects (i.e only non-primitive is allowed )
        4. which helps the programmer to perform the follwing task
            a.add an element into the collection 
            b.search an element in the collection 
            c.remove an element from the collection 
            d. access the elements present in the coolection

