**List interface:-
    List is an sub interface of collection interface
    Present inside java.util pakage
    it will follow linear data structure 
    it will have all the methods of collection interface

** Characteristics of List interface :
    insertion order is maintain
    duplicates are allowed
    null value can be added
    it is index based

** Implementation class :
    ArrayList
    LinkedList
    Vector
    Stack

**ArrayList :-
    ArrayList is an implentation (sub class) of list interface 
    interface from JDK 1.2
    present inside java.util pakage
    ArrayList will  store the data in the form of Array type  of object
    initial capacity of arraylist  10
    incrementation of capacity (Current capacity*3/2)+2
    it will follow global  array data structure
    it is suitable for search or fetch
